  "details": "Please separate the permission to change instance names from the permission to close an instance in the group's role settings, so they can be configured independently.\n\nIn a group where each member can create group instances, it would be convenient if the user who creates the instance could also set the instance name.\n\nCurrently, closing an instance and changing its name require the same permission, so it is not possible to grant permission to change the name without also allowing the user to close the instance.",
